efficiency improvements, making it ideal for production deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-usage"&gt;⚙️ Usage
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="-optimal-implementation"&gt;🎯 Optimal Implementation
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The most effective way to leverage this model is through the &lt;strong&gt;olmOCR toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;, which provides:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚡ Efficient inference setup via VLLM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📈 Scalability to handle millions of documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔄 Automatic rendering, rotation, and retry mechanisms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="-input-requirements"&gt;📐 Input Requirements
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The model expects input in a specific format:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Single document image&lt;/strong&gt; rendered with the longest dimension at &lt;strong&gt;1288 pixels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured prompts&lt;/strong&gt; containing document metadata (easily generated via olmOCR toolkit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
